for pydantic on py3.14
uv init repro && cd repro
1. Pin the pairing in pyproject.toml:
  [project]
  dependencies = ["pydantic>=2.12,<2.13"]

  [tool.uv]
  extra-index-url = ["https://termux-user-repository.github.io/pypi/"]
  index-strategy = "unsafe-first-match"
2. Re-resolve from scratch:
  rm -f uv.lock
  uv sync
3. Verify:
  uv run python -c "import pydantic, pydantic_core; print(pydantic.__version__, pydantic_core.__version__)"
